        "paragraph_number": 1,
        "obligation_type": "MANDATORY",
        "norm_statement": "Hospitalization areas or special units (operating rooms, ICUs, etc.) must be compartmentalized into at least two fire sectors, each with a constructed area not exceeding 1,500 m2 and with sufficient space to accommodate patients from an adjacent sector.",
